        6
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rome%2C_Ohio"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Stout Methodist Church, built in the late 1800s, stands as the town’s historic landmark.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        2,
        11,
