      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://nearbylens.com/cities/usa/oh/stout/"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Ohio River’s wide channel and seasonal flooding shaped Stout’s early river‑front settlement.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        8
